\n## Le Palazzo Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Le Palazzo.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1362 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 11.02 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1628 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 13.18 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1658 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 13.43 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1968 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 15.94 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nLe Palazzo's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malabar Hill.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Le Palazzo | Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 80950 | 80650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 0 | 95700 |\n| Dec 2025 | 56200 | 92350 |\n| Sep 2025 | 55350 | 76750 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nLe Palazzo avg. price is ₹ 81 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malabar Hill at ₹ 80.7 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [K Raheja Vivarea](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/k-raheja-vivarea/28107/project \"K Raheja Vivarea\") | ₹ 89,450 |\n| Current Project **Le Palazzo** | ₹ 80,950 |\n| Malabar Hill | ₹ 80,650 |\n| [Piramal Mahalaxmi Central Tower](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/piramal-mahalaxmi-central-tower/10420/project \"Piramal Mahalaxmi Central Tower\") | ₹ 72,650 |\n| [Piramal Mahalaxmi](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/piramal-mahalaxmi/10037/project \"Piramal Mahalaxmi\") | ₹ 71,350 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malabar Hill ranges from ₹ 97.1 K to ₹ 4.9 L with options available for 1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Le Palazzo | In Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 97.1 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 2 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 4.9 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Le Palazzo.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Le Palazzo, amounting to ₹ 32 Cr till August 2026.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Le Palazzo moved from ₹ 56,800/sqft to ₹ 80,950/sqft, reflecting a 42.52% rise.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Le Palazzo moved from ₹ 56,200/sqft to ₹ 56,800/sqft, reflecting a 1.07% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Le Palazzo moved from ₹ 55,350/sqft to ₹ 56,200/sqft, reflecting a 1.54% rise.\n\nA total of 33 out of 52 launched units have been booked as of November 2025.\n\nA total of 33 out of 52 launched units have been booked as of October 2024.\n\nA total of 31 out of 52 launched units have been booked as of July 2024.\n\nStructural Works reach 80% completion, External Works has reached 85%, Internal finishing stands at 80%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 95% done.\n\nA total of 31 out of 52 launched units have been booked as of June 2022.\n\nLE PALAZZO, developed by Sri Harsh Developers, officially launched on 01-Sep-2017 and expected to complete by 31-Aug-2026. Registered under RERA No. P51900012304. The project comprises 1 towers and offers 52 residential units, with unit sizes ranging from 1356 to 12906 Square feet with total area of 1.96 Acre.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Le Palazzo From Sep 25 to Aug 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 61.5 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 32 Cr | ₹ 61,550 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Sep 25 to Aug 26\n\n## Le Palazzo Floor Plans\n\n### 3 BHK 1362 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 11.02 Cr**\n\n### 3 BHK 1628 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 13.18 Cr**\n\n### 4 BHK 1658 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 13.43 Cr**\n\n### 4 BHK 1968 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 15.94 Cr**\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Le Palazzo\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Le Palazzo to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Le Palazzo Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/le-palazzo-project-amenities-features1-4507.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Le Palazzo Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/le-palazzo-project-amenities-features5-7930.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Le Palazzo\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-cafecoff-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Sri Harsh Developers Malabar Hill\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai South](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Le Palazzo.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Le Palazzo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/le-palazzo-project-project-large-image1-4622.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Sava Sadan Society School\n\n#### August Kranti Maidan Bus Stand\n\n#### Nana Chowk Municipal Dispensary Fire Brigade Compound\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malabar Hill\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\n![Locality rank](/assets/images/key-insights-icon/locality-rank.svg)\n\nBased on demand, livability, and activity\n\nMalabar Hill remains one of the peaceful and scenic localities in Mumbai. The abundance of lush green spaces like Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park, combined with stunning views of the Arabian Sea, offers a serene escape from the city's fast pace. The roads are well-maintained, street lighting is good, and the neighborhood feels safe even late at night. Access to top-tier schools, premier healthcare facilities, and South Mumbai's key business hubs makes living here incredibly convenient and comfortable.\n\n— SOURABH, Owner\n\n## RERA Details of Le Palazzo\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Le Palazzo From Sep 25 to Aug 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 61.5 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-01-29 | Floor 40, 41, Unit 4001, 4101 | N/A | 4,409 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-28 | Floor 18, Unit 1802 | N/A | 2,005 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-06 | Floor 38, Unit 3801 | N/A | 2,674 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-05 | Floor 39, Unit 3901 | N/A | 1,721 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Le Palazzo compare with similar projects?\n\n![Le Palazzo project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-le-palazzo-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Le Palazzo](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/le-palazzo/65245/project \"Le Palazzo\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![K Raheja Vivarea Mumbai project in Mahalaxmi, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-k-raheja-vivarea-mumbai-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [K Raheja Vivarea Mumbai](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/k-raheja-vivarea-mumbai/3470/project \"K Raheja Vivarea Mumbai\")\n\nMahalaxmi, Mumbai\n\n![Piramal Mahalaxmi project in Mahalaxmi, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-piramal-mahalaxmi-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Piramal Mahalaxmi](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/piramal-mahalaxmi/10037/project \"Piramal Mahalaxmi\")\n\nMahalaxmi, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Le Palazzo Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Le Palazzo located at Malabar Hill Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\n## Sri Harsh Developers Track Record\n\n![Sri Harsh Developers logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/sri-harsh-developers-21583-2190.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![K Raheja Vivarea residential project in Mahalaxmi](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-k-raheja-vivarea--project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMahalaxmi, Mumbai\n\n3,4 BHK\n\n₹ 13.50 Cr to 17.50 Cr\n\n![Piramal Mahalaxmi Central Tower residential project in Mahalaxmi](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-piramal-mahalaxmi-central-tower-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMahalaxmi, Mumbai\n\n3,4 BHK\n\n₹ 10.99 Cr to 14.23 Cr\n\n![Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl residential project in Girgaon](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-hindustan-klockner-sea-pearl-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGirgaon, Mumbai\n\n2,3,4 BHK\n\n₹ 3.70 Cr to 13.55 Cr\n\n![Indiabulls Blu Tower A residential project in Worli](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-indiabulls-blu-tow