=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nTardeo, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Shapoorji Pallonji JK Tower residential project in Gamdevi](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shapoorji-pallonji-jk-tower-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGamdevi, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Vikas residential project in Peddar Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-vikas-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Umang residential project in Gamdevi](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-umang-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGamdevi, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Sugan residential project in Kemps Corner](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-sugan-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKemps Corner, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Neelambar residential project in Peddar Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-neelambar-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru House Of Soviet Culture residential project in Peddar Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-house-of-soviet-culture-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Ajay residential project in Peddar Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-ajay-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Lodha Altamount residential project in Altamount Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-altamount-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAltamount Road, Mumbai\n\n3, 4, 5 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 17.46 Cr to 40.40 Cr\n\n![Kalpataru Parag residential project in Peddar Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-parag-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Tata Petit Towers residential project in Peddar Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/tata-petit-towers-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 16.49 Cr\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Le Palazzo\n\n### Is Le Palazzo RERA registered?\n\nYes, purchasing apartment at Le Palazzo is legally safe, as the project has a possession status of Ready to Move and is registered under RERA with registration number P51900012304. Being a completed development, it significantly reduces construction, delivery, and compliance risks compared to under-construction projects\n\n### Is buying a flat in Le Palazzo legally safe?\n\nYes, Le Palazzo is registered under RERA with registration number P51900012304, ensuring transparency and regulatory compliance.\n\n### What is the price range of flats in Le Palazzo?\n\nApartment prices at Le Palazzo start from ₹ 11.02 Cr and go up to ₹ 15.94 Cr, with an average price of ₹ 80,950 Per Sq. Ft. per sq ft.\n\n### When was Le Palazzo completed and is it ready for possession?\n\nLe Palazzo has received its completion and occupancy approvals. With a possession status of Ready to Move, buyers can move in immediately after completing purchase formalities.\n\n### What configurations are available at Le Palazzo?\n\nLe Palazzo offers 3, 4 BHK Flats catering to different space and budget requirements.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/home-loan.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/valuation.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/sell-or-rent-property.png)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n![Lodha](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg)\n![Kalpataru](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kalpataru-532-5000.jpg)\n![Hiranandani](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/hiranandani-451.jpg)\n![Runwal](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/runwal-538-4155.jpg)\n![Rustomjee](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rustomjee-599.jpg)\n![Mayfair Housing](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mayfair-housing-585.jpg)\n![Godrej](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/godrej-49-2414.jpg)\n![Chandak](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/chandak-1050.jpg)\n![Mahindra Lifespaces](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahindra-lifespaces-68.jpg)\n![Shapoorji Pallonji](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/shapoorji-pallonji-494.jpg)\n![Kalpataru Vian](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-vian-project-project-large-image1-5543-opt-460392f9-2d11-4a1c-b830-fba5e810b682.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Ahana](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-ahana-project-project-large-image1-4621-opt-3fdf8c3f-c784-42fd-b0f5-4398c6901234.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Purva Estrella](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/purva-estrella-project-project-large-image1-3989-opt-3a6c3ad5-4526-45bf-b146-a3e451ce03ed.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Adani Linkbay Residences](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/adani-linkbay-residences-project-project-large-image1-2560.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-project-large-image1-2484.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Rainforest](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-rainforest-project-project-large-image1-5108-opt-1de55a7d-9847-4c14-bd04-8125e6d5a57d.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Meadows](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-meadows-project-project-large-image1-8749-opt-0576b543-8352-4304-ab97-6c63b05f3057.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![GHP Mars Suncity](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ghp-mars-suncity-project-project-large-image1-7362.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Bliss](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-bliss-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Elixir Reserve](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-elixir-reserve-project-project-large-image1-6960.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![voice search]()\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/maharera-project/terraces-forjett-hill/P51900052101","title":"Terraces Forjett Hill, Malabar Hill — RERA & Possession | MPE","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply 